span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 积函子</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>A</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-)^A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0913em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 指数函子</td>\n<td>柯里化 / 笛卡尔闭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余极限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{colim}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">colim</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>对角函子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>余极限的存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对角函子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>极限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lim</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>极限的存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存在量词 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exists</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>代换（拉回）</td>\n<td>谓词逻辑的量词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代换（拉回）</td>\n<td>全称量词 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>谓词逻辑的量词</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行的「积左伴随于指数」就是柯里化的范畴论本质，它定义了笛卡尔闭范畴，是 <a href=\"../applications/category-theory-in-cs\">范畴论与计算机科学</a> 里类型化 lambda 演算模型的支点。最后两行把量词刻画为沿投影的伴随，是 <a href=\"../applications/categorical-logic-topos\">范畴逻辑与拓扑斯</a> 的核心，由劳威尔（Lawvere）发现。同一个定义照亮自由代数、极限存在、柯里化、逻辑量词，这种统一力是伴随被推崇的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"伴随的保持性定理\">伴随的保持性定理</h2><p>伴随不只是分类工具，它还携带一条极有用的结构后果：左伴随保持所有余极限，右伴随保持所有极限（缩写为 RAPL / LAPC）。这解释了上一篇 <a href=\"../universal-constructions/limits-colimits\">极限与余极限</a> 里那条悬而未证的论断——为什么右伴随函子总把极限搬过去而不破坏。</p>\n<p>这条定理日用价值很高。比如要判断某函子不可能有左伴随，只需找到一个它不保持的极限即可一票否决；遗忘函子保持极限（积、等化子原样保留）这一观察，反过来提示它该有左伴随（即自由构造），这正是伴随函子存在定理的思路。米田引理在这里也现身：伴随的唯一性（左伴随若存在则在自然同构意义下唯一）正是用可表性与 <a href=\"yoneda-lemma\">米田引理</a> 证出的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⊣</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F\\dashv G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>：自然双射 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≅</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">C</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal{D}}(F(A),B)\\cong\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal{C}}(A,G(B))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Hom</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Hom</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0583em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，左为自由方向、右为遗忘方向。</li>\n<li>等价的单位—余单位表述用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta,\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 加三角恒等式，便于计算，且是单子的母体。</li>\n<li>自由构造、极限存在、柯里化、逻辑量词全是伴随的特例——「伴随无处不在」。</li>\n<li>左伴随保持余极限、右伴随保持极限（RAPL/LAPC），可用于一票否决某函子有伴随。</li>\n<li>伴随若存在则唯一到自然同构，由米田引理保证。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>它的母体角色在此兑现：<a href=\"monads\">单子</a></li>\n<li>它解释了极限保持性：<a href=\"../universal-constructions/limits-colimits\">极限与余极限</a></li>\n<li>唯一性靠它证明：<a href=\"yoneda-lemma\">米田引理</a></li>\n<li>柯里化即「积左伴随于指数」：<a href=\"../applications/category-theory-in-cs\">范畴论与计算机科学</a></li>\n<li>自由构造的最朴素来源（自由群）：<a href=\"../../abstract-algebra/groups/group-definition\">群的定义</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"伴随","id":"伴随"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"单位、余单位与三角恒等式","id":"单位-余单位与三角恒等式"},{"level":2,"text":"处处都是伴随","id":"处处都是伴随"},{"level":2,"text":"伴随的保持性定理","id":"伴随的保持性定理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"米田引理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/category-theory/core-theorems/yoneda-lemma"},"next":{"title":"单子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/category-theory/core-theorems/monads"}}